CORE
contract.sol
--contract ExactState --solidity-path-coverage --solidity-max-tx 1 --path-cov-assert spec.json --memlimit 8g
^--path-cov-assert: region NON-VACUITY witnessed
^--path-cov-assert: return: a value IS returned on this path \(REFUTED == yes\)  REFUTED
^--path-cov-assert: return: return == 0  REFUTED
^--path-cov-assert: return: return != 0  HOLDS
^--path-cov-assert: ladder summary -- 3 candidate\(s\): 1 HOLDS, 2 REFUTED, 0 no verdict \(solver unknown\), 0 no verdict \(never reached the solver\)
\A(?!(.|\n)*unrelated: post)
\A(?!(.|\n)*REFUSING THE LADDER)
